      "body": "\n<div>\n<div>\n\n\n\n<div>\n\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:25b0f289cf8c5cb9754529898c599e91a55c5fcfee1a77634dbc382ee1885284\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:859c07616b0be47452b3af4f398db74dcd82b34ff38db7ca63afa96dd9fe1b99\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:52b47a476a1a2216ae22c86ee05bbb5b44e78fa494973d0506ce8c8c46433ba4\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:b8c6cdf1bba0e3bbd23a50124daac496aed266c1293fbb251a043ece28c6482c\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"asset:e95c8bf91ee00505dc751786e48b85e4a0f528ef8fff5ba749f4e17da0e98971\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>\n\n\t이번 앨범 초동 60만장 찍은 시점부터<br/>\n<br/>\n유튜브나 커뮤니티에 리센느 악플개수가<br/>\n<br/>\n20만개정도에서 227만개정도로 늘어났다고 함 ㅋㅋㅋㅋ<br/>\n<br/>\n중소돌은 조금만 뜰려고 하면 역바이럴에 억까에 악플에...<br/>\n<br/>\n참......\n\n</p>\n",
